/- English proof (translation)
Unfold `_root_.GlobalTheory.BigOn.Exp.ReadInjAlt _root_.GlobalTheory.BigOn.Exp.TwistConditions _root_.GlobalTheory.BigOn.AtPtsAlt`. Use `⟨1, one_pos, fun _ _ _ => ⟨⟨0, fun _ => 0, fun _ => 0, fun _ => 0⟩, fun Fm CH _ _ => ⟨0, fun x hx _ i p hr hm w _ j ρ hρ ν hν => ?_⟩⟩⟩` and prove the remaining obligations. Take `⟨Z⟩` from `hm.2.2.series`. Establish `hU : p.R.toRealDat.LUnif` using `hr.prim.unif`. Establish `hW : p.R.toRealDat.models_HW` using `p.charW.base.models.HW`.

Establish `hK : (p.Sx.A ((j : ℕ) + 1)).IsKsForm` using `GlobalTheory.isKsForm_of_formsIso _ _ (p.nexp.fi j) (p.fw.ks j)`. Conclude with `(GlobalTheory.SeriesTie.realRd_faithful _ _ _ _ _ _ _ p.R p.cG p.Sx p.nexp p.v₀ ρ hρ _ j _ ν hν hU hW (Z.vec j) hK).injective`.
-/
theorem readInj_alt : _root_.GlobalTheory.BigOn.Exp.ReadInjAlt := by
  unfold _root_.GlobalTheory.BigOn.Exp.ReadInjAlt _root_.GlobalTheory.BigOn.Exp.TwistConditions _root_.GlobalTheory.BigOn.AtPtsAlt
  refine ⟨1, one_pos, fun _ _ _ => ⟨⟨0, fun _ => 0, fun _ => 0, fun _ => 0⟩, fun Fm CH _ _ =>
